## Example .env file - copy to .env and adapt for MyMemory + Lingva
# Increase anonymous MyMemory quota by providing a generic email (optional)
MYMEMORY_DE=anon@example.com
# Optional: override MyMemory endpoint (default uses api.mymemory.translated.net/get)
# MYMEMORY_ENDPOINT=https://api.mymemory.translated.net/get
# Optional: Lingva instance endpoint (fallback)
# LINGVA_ENDPOINT=https://lingva.ml

# Note: This project no longer uses Azure or Google paid APIs; remove any AZURE_/GOOGLE_ vars.
